# request: "Roadmap slide for the engineering all-hands, Q3 2026 to Q2 2027, per
#  stream. Platform: the Postgres 18 upgrade runs through Q4 (in progress), then
#  multi-region failover in the first half of 2027. Data: Snowpipe ingest is done;
#  the Snowflake cutover lands Nov 14, then we retire Redshift in Q1. AI: the
#  support bot beta runs to year end, GA in Q1 is at risk. Mobile: App 5.0 is done,
#  nothing in Q4, offline mode in the first half of 2027. Show status with a key
#  and highlight the cutover."
type: roadmap
reader: engineers at the all-hands (slide, shown at doc width)
width: 800
direction: down   # periods run right, streams stack down
focus: data.cutover
out: owners, dependencies between items, exact start and end dates
nodes:
  head.a: Q3 2026
  head.b: Q4 2026
  head.c: Q1 2027
  head.d: Q2 2027
  platform: Platform
  platform.pg: Postgres 18 upgrade
  platform.dr: Multi-region failover
  data: Data
  data.pipe: Snowpipe ingest
  data.cutover: Snowflake cutover\nNov 14
  data.redshift: Retire Redshift
  ai: AI
  ai.beta: Support bot beta
  ai.ga: Support bot GA
  mobile: Mobile
  mobile.app: App 5.0
  mobile.offline: Offline mode
  status.done: Done
  status.doing: In progress
  status.planned: Planned
  status.risk: At risk
edges:
